  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa: Digital innovation accelerator for African SMEs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This two-year project will support the implementation of the &amp;ldquo;Hundred Stores and Thousand Products on Platform&amp;rdquo; initiative under the Digital Innovation Project of the &amp;ldquo;China-Africa Cooperation Vision 2035&amp;rdquo;. Through cooperation with &amp;quot;Silk Road E-commerce&amp;quot; initiative, it will enhance the international market competitiveness of African SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
